<Layout title="about" description={SITE.description}>
	<div class="stack">
		<RainbowBars />

		<h1 class="display">Berk Kırık</h1>

		<p class="small" style="text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--fg-muted);">
			Senior AI Engineer · Ankara, Türkiye
		</p>

		<p>
			I build production ML systems — LLM fine-tuning, RAG pipelines, multi-tenant
			NER, agentic AI, and the Kubernetes infra underneath. Currently at <a
				href="https://www.etiya.com/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener">Etiya</a>; previously at <a href="https://im-par.de/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Im-Par</a>
			(Frankfurt) and <a href="https://www.tigahealth.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tiga</a>
			(Ankara). MSc Computer Engineering at Ankara University; co-author on a
			<a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-025-34095-z" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nature Scientific Reports paper</a>
			on Kolmogorov–Arnold networks.
